  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "quillip_meeting_open",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "Quillip! Maps, small discoveries, occasional corrections. Mostly corrections this morning. Come close; the map is my size.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "not_flag": "met_quillip"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "set_flag": "met_quillip",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "quillip_meeting_question"
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_meeting_question",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "I have drawn the terrace from my perch. What would you want to find on a map you could walk with?",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "A comfortable place to stop.",
          "next": "quillip_meeting_value_1"
        },
        {
          "text": "The view from the ground.",
          "next": "quillip_meeting_value_2"
        },
        {
          "text": "A little space to add something.",
          "next": "quillip_meeting_value_3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_meeting_value_1",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "A stop! I have marked seven things to pass and nothing to stay beside. That does seem an omission.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": "quillip_meeting_close"
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_meeting_value_2",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "Yes, the ground. I keep giving it very elegant outlines. You could tell me what happens between the outlines.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": "quillip_meeting_close"
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_meeting_value_3",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "Blank space on purpose? I was about to fill that corner with a second drawing of the first tree. Your idea is roomier.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": "quillip_meeting_close"
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_meeting_close",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "My consultation ledge is down here. You need not borrow wings to help with a map.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_greeting_dawn_clear",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Clear dawn. The far cliff has a golden edge. I shall enjoy it before trying to draw all of it.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "time": "dawn"
        },
        {
          "weather": "clear"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_greeting_dawn_rain",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "A rainy dawn! The map is under its hood. I am beside it, making a very small additional roof.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "time": "dawn"
        },
        {
          "weather": "rain"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_greeting_day_clear",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Good day. That bend looks different from down here. Same bend, entirely new opinion.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "time": "day"
        },
        {
          "weather": "clear"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_greeting_day_rain",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Rain makes the covered walk easy to appreciate. I should ask Copperleaf where to put its rest marks.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "time": "day"
        },
        {
          "weather": "rain"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_greeting_dusk_clear",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Dusk has joined two distant trees into one shape. I will keep them separate on paper. Probably.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "time": "dusk"
        },
        {
          "weather": "clear"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_greeting_dusk_rain",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Evening rain. I have folded the map inward so the interesting part stays dry. That was a satisfying decision.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "time": "dusk"
        },
        {
          "weather": "rain"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_greeting_night_clear",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Clear night. The windows make a tempting pattern to copy, but a route needs more than dots.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "time": "night"
        },
        {
          "weather": "clear"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_greeting_night_rain",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "The map is dry tonight. My tail was briefly less so. I have adjusted both the tail and my position.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "time": "night"
        },
        {
          "weather": "rain"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_quest_offer",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "My terrace map has a fine view and nowhere to stop. Will you explore the sightline from the ground and mark one comfortable pause?",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_quillip_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_quillip_accepted"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "I'll look from the ground and find a stop.",
          "next": "quillip_quest_accept"
        },
        {
          "text": "I'll visit your map another time.",
          "next": "quillip_quest_defer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_quest_accept",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Meet me at the map perch. We can spread the foldout on the low ledge before you explore.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_quillip_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_quillip_accepted"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "set_flag": "q_quillip_accepted",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "quillip_quest_travel_wait"
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_quest_defer",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Of course. I shall leave that corner blank. It will be a small exercise in not drawing another tree.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_quillip_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_quillip_accepted"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_quest_travel_wait",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Visit the map perch when you like. The low consultation ledge is reachable on foot.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_quillip_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_quillip_accepted"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_quillip_prepared"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_quest_prepare",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Here is the foldout at the map perch. Shall we look across the terrace from ground level and find a comfortable stopping place?",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_quillip_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_quillip_accepted"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_quillip_prepared"
        },
        {
          "visited": "map_perch"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Yes. I'll explore the sightline and mark a stop.",
          "next": "quillip_quest_prepared"
        },
        {
          "text": "Which stopping places can I consider?",
          "next": "quillip_quest_detail"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_quest_detail",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "The near bench or the covered overlook. Explore whichever suits you, then mark it on the foldout. No distant expedition required.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_quillip_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_quillip_accepted"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_quillip_prepared"
        },
        {
          "visited": "map_perch"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Yes. I'll explore the sightline and mark a stop.",
          "next": "quillip_quest_prepared"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
