    {
      "id": "quillip_quest_after",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "A stopping place changes the whole route. I keep looking at the map and imagining the view from that pause.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_quillip_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": "quillip_quest_after_detail"
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_quest_after_detail",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "The empty corner remains empty. This is unusually good news about something I have drawn.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_quillip_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_relationship_acquaintance",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "What can you see from there? I am collecting ground-level opinions. Yours need not agree with my perch.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_quillip_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_relationship_friend",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "You found something useful between my outlines. I would like to walk a little route with you, as a friend, without drawing all of it.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_quillip_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "friend_quillip"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "set_flag": "friend_quillip",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "quillip_relationship_friend_reply"
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_relationship_friend_reply",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "I shall still point at things. Friendship cannot possibly require me to stop pointing at things.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "flag": "friend_quillip"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_relationship_friend_repeat",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "A bend, a patch of moss, a familiar visitor. Today has arranged itself nicely.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "flag": "friend_quillip"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_relationship_trusted",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "At the gathering, I stopped looking for the best overview. There you were, close enough to see without leaving my ledge.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "flag": "friend_quillip"
        },
        {
          "flag": "m_festival_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "trusted_quillip"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "set_flag": "trusted_quillip",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "quillip_relationship_trusted_reply"
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_relationship_trusted_reply",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "I like being beside someone who can find me interesting at ground level. Even when I have no new map.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "flag": "trusted_quillip"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_relationship_trusted_repeat",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "I brought no paper today. If we discover something wonderful, we can just spend a little time with it.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "flag": "trusted_quillip"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_festival_before",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "festival",
      "text": "The arrival notice makes the route look simpler than it feels underfoot. I would like to mark places for an unhurried welcome.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "m_agreement_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "m_festival_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_festival_ready_clear",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "festival",
      "text": "The shared plan includes ground displays and places to pause. I can enjoy the wide view from my low ledge.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "flag": "m_agreement_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "m_festival_done"
        },
        {
          "weather": "clear"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_festival_ready_rain",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "festival",
      "text": "The covered route belongs on the gathering map. So does every dry place where a visitor can linger.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "flag": "m_agreement_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "m_festival_done"
        },
        {
          "weather": "rain"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_festival_after",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "festival",
      "text": "Guests reached the lanterns by different routes. I kept leaving room for their stories, and the map never felt unfinished.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        },
        {
          "flag": "m_festival_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_idle_1",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "idle",
      "text": "Nuzzle can find a bend underneath a bend I have already drawn. There is a great deal of world close to the ground.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_idle_2",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "idle",
      "text": "I named that corner Crooked Twig. The twig has moved. The corner is being very patient about it.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_quillip"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quillip_idle_3",
      "speaker": "quillip",
      "kind": "idle",
      "text": "Thimble left a little perch near the garden. From there, one flower can take up nearly the whole view.",
